abstract: >
  QuantumOX is an advanced Tic Tac Toe engine that supports the Universal Tic Tac Toe Interface (UTTTI).
  It is part of the QuantumKing ecosystem and is designed with a focus on performance, search optimization,
  and platform compatibility. Built with modern C++ standards and optimized heuristics.

